### Feature ProductType — GET ALL / GET ONE
### SIN AUTH (Fase I — Business)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

### GET ALL — solo tipos activos
# @name getAllProductTypes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types

### GET ONE — 404 si no existe o está inactivo
# @name getOneProductType
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}

### 400 — :id no numérico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/abc
